      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Watch for overlap.\n\nFor 13 papers, 'first 7' and 'last 7' both contain paper 7.\nIf you add those two subtotals, paper 7 is counted twice.\n\nSo overlap value = first-subtotal + last-subtotal − whole-total.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
